src/coal/kaks.cpp and src/coal/kaks.hpp (the Ka/Ks engine) are derived from:

- KaKs_Calculator 2.0 (kakscalculator2 2.0.1, https://github.com/kullrich/kakscalculator2; original project
  https://sourceforge.net/projects/kakscalculator2/): base.cpp (Fisher's exact test, the derived output
  values), NG86.cpp, LWL85.cpp, LPB93.cpp, YN00.cpp, MYN.cpp. (COAL's command-line program also reproduces the
  output header of KaKs.cpp, in kaks_cli.cpp; that file is not part of this package.)
